            </span>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-background mb-4">The <span class="text-primary">core principles</span> behind our work</h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                We build every engagement around trust, human partnership, and measurable impact.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="icon-tile mb-0">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">shield_lock</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Zero-Trust by Design</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                    We never treat security as an afterthought. Your digital teammates operate inside private Sovereign Nodes with strict no-training, contractual zero-retention rules to protect your private data boundaries.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="icon-tile mb-0">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">groups</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Human Augmentation, Not Replacement</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                    We build software to collaborate with your team, not replace them. Our tools handle the repetitive manual tasks under strict Human-in-the-Loop guardrails so your people can focus on strategy and real human connection.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="icon-tile mb-0">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">verified</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Uncompromising Integrity</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                    We value verified facts over guesswork. Our system is engineered to check every record, flag conflicts, and refuse to invent false citations or alter data under pressure.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="icon-tile mb-0">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">hub</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Ecosystem Synergy</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                    We partner wholesale with marketing agencies, consultants, and advisors rather than forcing high-friction direct sales. We create a win-win platform where trusted partners bring enterprise technology to their existing clients.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group lg:col-span-2">
                <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                    <div class="icon-tile mb-0">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">bolt</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Practical Real-World Impact</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    We build modular, fast-launch software designed to clear immediate office bottlenecks today, giving growing businesses and legal teams the reach of a much larger staff.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
